# Once SOUTH-YORKSHIRE-BACKEND is hosted on Render (its own auth + DB,
# separate from GMBTE), point this at it. Until then this falls back to
# GMBTE's shared backend, which is why the Business Studio / Academy /
# Climate calls still hit GMBTE's actual production API.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://gmbtebackend.onrender.com

# Once SOUTH-YORKSHIRE-BACKEND/idea-engine/ is deployed as its own Render
# service (own DB, JWT_SECRET matching the main SY backend's), point this
# at it. The fallback below is an unrelated dev deployment — don't rely
# on it for real use.
NEXT_PUBLIC_IDEA_ENGINE_URL=https://ideaengiene-avcv.onrender.com
